from opening.replay
# One real wild battle on Route 201. After the opening (Piplup L5 at
# Lake Verity), wild encounters battle again; the player walks south onto Route 201 and paces in the tall
# grass west of Sandgem (x 116–125, z 853) until a wild Pokémon appears, then fights with the strongest
# move until it faints. Seeds 1–3 meet different Pokémon. Save round trips before and after the battle.
# Runs headless in tests/integration/m2-wild.rom.test.ts and in the browser (desktop and phone).
+0 wild battle
+0 reload
# leave Lake Verity onto Route 201 (as cp2)
+0 press down
until position 46 54
+0 release down
until idle
+0 press b
+0 press down
until position 80 853
+0 release down
+0 press right
until position 115 853
+0 release right
+0 release b
# pace in the grass, walking: 5 tiles each way. Once a battle starts these presses reach its intro and
# move nothing (the command card is answered by `battle auto`).
+0 press right
+40 release right
+0 press left
+40 release left
+0 press right
+40 release right
+0 press left
+40 release left
+0 press right
+40 release right
+0 press left
+40 release left
+0 press right
+40 release right
+0 press left
+40 release left
+0 press right
+40 release right
+0 press left
+40 release left
until battle 900
+0 screenshot battle-command
+0 assert battles wild 0
battle auto 6000
+0 assert battle wild * won
+0 assert battles wild 1
+0 assert state party[0].species "platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP"
# Trainer score: the starter (a first catch, 20), the first battle (a trainer battle, 3), this wild win (2).
+0 assert state records.score 25
until idle
+0 reload
+0 assert map platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_201
until idle
